What Are Public Address and Voice Alarm Systems?
Public Address and Voice Alarm (PAVA) systems are critical life safety installations designed for mass notification across commercial spaces, transport hubs, and public facilities. These sophisticated networks integrate audio components (amplifiers, speakers), control units, and increasingly, cloud-based management platforms to deliver crystal-clear emergency messaging. Modern systems now incorporate AI-driven noise cancellation and IoT sensors to maintain 99.9% system reliability - a mandatory requirement under EU safety directives like EN 54-16.

